 type="number" name="pg_price_from" min="0"></div><div class="col-md-2"><label class="form-label">Gender</label><select class="form-select" name="pg_gender"><option value="co_living">Co-living</option><option value="male">Male</option><option value="female">Female</option></select></div><div class="col-md-2"><label class="form-label">Room type</label><select class="form-select" name="pg_room_type"><option value="single">Single</option><option value="double">Double</option><option value="triple">Triple</option></select></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary-custom text-white mt-3" type="submit">Add property</button><?php endif; ?></form></div><?php endif; ?><div class="panel"><?php if (in_array($section, ['Reports', 'Settings'], true)): ?><div class="p-4 bg-light rounded-4"><h4><?= e($section) ?> workspace</h4><p class="text-secondary mb-0"><?= $section === 'Reports' ? 'Platform reporting is ready for export integrations.' : 'Platform settings are managed securely from this workspace.' ?></p></div><?php elseif (!$rows): ?><p class="text-secondary mb-0">No records available yet.</p><?php else: ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><thead><tr><?php foreach (array_keys($rows[0]) as $heading): if ($heading === 'id') continue; ?><th><?= e(ucwords(str_replace('_', ' ', $heading))) ?></th><?php endforeach; ?></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach ($rows as $row): ?><tr><?php foreach ($row as $key => $value): if ($key === 'id') continue; ?><td><?= e((string) $value) ?></td><?php endforeach; ?></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php endif; ?></div></div></main></div></body><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script></html>
